/T (Balm Therapeutic Services is led by Philip Dimka, a Psychologist, Trauma Therapist, and Play Therapist with extensive experience in individual therapy, trauma recovery, child and adolescent mental health, relationship work, and humanitarian psychosocial support. His expertise spans ACEs research, trauma intervention, socioemotional development, and community resilience programming. He earned a Bachelor of Science degree in General & Applied Psychology from the University of Jos, Nigeria, and a Master of Science degree in Clinical Psychology. )
/E (Balm Therapeutic Services is led by Philip Dimka, a Psychologist, Trauma Therapist, and Play Therapist with extensive experience in individual therapy, trauma recovery, child and adolescent mental health, relationship work, and humanitarian psychosocial support. His expertise spans ACEs research, trauma intervention, socioemotional development, and community resilience programming. He earned a Bachelor of Science degree in General & Applied Psychology from the University of Jos, Nigeria, and a Master of Science degree in Clinical Psychology. )
