/Title (Balm Therapeutic Services is a leading mental health and psychosocial support practice based in Jos, Nigeria. We provide compassionate, evidence-based psychological services to children, adolescents, adults, couples, and families. Our work is grounded in trauma-informed care, clinical psychology, and culturally resonant therapeutic practices that promote emotional well-being, resilience, and healthy relationships.)
